            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThese quotes are updated on a regular basis, at different intervals. If you have any questions, please reach out to \u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:helpdesk@ggusd.us\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003E\u003Cu\u003Ehelpdesk@ggusd.us\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/a\u003E or ext. 77180.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(108, 117, 125); font-size: 17.6px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003EFor unlisted items, please check the current approved vendors and resellers websites for listings for a variety of peripherals, this includes\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul style=\u0022box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1.5em; margin-top: 0px; padding-left: 20px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(46, 46, 46); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 17.6px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECDW-G (\u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://cdwg.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Ehttps://cdwg.com\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDell (\u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://dell.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Ehttps://dell.com\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESupplyMaster (\u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://supplymaster.com/\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Ehttps://supplymaster.com/\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0px; color: rgb(108, 117, 125); font-size: 17.6px; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\u0022\u003ETo see the latest additions, changes, and updates to the click \u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022https://it.ggusd.us/it/support/it-quotes-update-log/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 title=\u0022\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003EQuotes page\u003C/a\u003E here.\u003C/p\u003E"
